  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Peer feedback field guide"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "45 minutes | 8 adults | Four pairs"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Help each participant make one considered revision to a short draft. Participants practise giving…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Prepare before people arrive"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Bring this guide, blank paper, pens and a visible timer. Ask each participant to bring a short draft…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Check the room, routes, seating and agreed access arrangements with the host. Set a place for someone…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Worked example"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Draft: “Join our workshop soon. Bring what you need.” Feedback: “I cannot find the date or the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The feedback names a specific missing detail and explains its effect on the reader. The author still…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Opening words"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "We will practise one useful response to a draft. Share only what you choose. You may pass, work with…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Run the session"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Elapsed times begin when the session starts. Keep the closing time visible. Give a one minute notice…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Check the practice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Listen for a specific reference to the draft and a clear reader need. If feedback is only “good” or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Preserve choice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A participant who passes may use the worked example or observe the exchange. Count that as a chosen…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Adjust when the plan changes"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If the start is five minutes late"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use the 40 minute route: welcome 3, example 4, quiet draft 4, pairs 14, revision 9, closing 6. Keep the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If someone prefers not to share"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Offer the fictional example or private writing. Do not ask for a personal reason. Check quietly whether…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If a group finishes early"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask the author to identify one response they will use and one they will set aside, with a reason. Keep…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If discussion becomes personal"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Pause the exchange and return attention to the work. Say: Let us name the detail in the draft and the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "If the room or materials are unsuitable"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Pause and agree a workable adjustment with the host and participants. Do not assume a smaller group or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Adjustment made and reason: _____________________________________________"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Debrief and record"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Ask the group"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "What changed in your draft after the exchange? Ask this first. Then ask: What made a response useful to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Participants may answer aloud, write privately or pass. Do not require a positive takeaway."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Record the session"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Date and facilitator: ______________________________________________________ Actual start and end:…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Activity completed and any change to the plan:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "One observed example and its context:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Participant feedback in their words or a clearly marked paraphrase:"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Choose the next revision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Name one change to this guide, the evidence behind it and who will make it. Keep interpretation…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Next revision and owner: _________________________________________________"
    }
  ],
